    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "msgctxt": "485500",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 2,
      "en": "Only after persuading the heart's owner\nwill you be allowed to escape. Are you ready?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 63,
      "msgctxt": "485676",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Once I enter the relief, I won't be able\nto leave until I beat #C236196003Rin#CDEF.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 64,
      "msgctxt": "485772",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Excellent. Now, I will send #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF inside\nby converting them into spiritron particles.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 65,
      "msgctxt": "485940",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 2,
      "en": "Huh? Just the Master?\nYou're leaving the Servant as is?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 66,
      "msgctxt": "486000",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 2,
      "en": "Of course. I will run my own process for\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF, but a Servant need only align with\ntheir Master's Spiritron rank to materialize.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 67,
      "msgctxt": "486148",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 2,
      "en": "Furthermore, once Master #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF's\nquasi-Spiritron rank changes, their Servant's\nspirit-rank will automatically follow suit.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 68,
      "msgctxt": "486312",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 2,
      "en": "Servants sync to their Master's bio-levels, huh.\nThings are getting more occulty by the minute.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 69,
      "msgctxt": "486604",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 2,
      "en": "Good luck. I'll be taking your word for it.\nNow, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, close your eyes and relax.\nEntrust your consciousness to me.",
      "pt": ""
    },
