      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "　You cannot carry any more\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF.",
      "pt": "　Você não pode carregar mais\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."
    },
    {
      "id": 95,
      "msgctxt": "499492",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 100,
      "en": "After making a shortcut to the old school from\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF, please return to base.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 96,
      "msgctxt": "499596",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 100,
      "en": "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, you appear to have accumulated\na lot of fatigue. I recommend that\nyou return for the moment to take a rest.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 97,
      "msgctxt": "499732",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 10,
      "en": "She's right.\nLet's listen to #C236196003Sakura#CDEF and head back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 98,
      "msgctxt": "499828",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 100,
      "en": "I'm concerned about #C236196003Rin#CDEF.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 99,
      "msgctxt": "499872",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 101,
      "en": "Searching the Labyrinth is nice and all,\nbut I should #C000246204return to the old school#CDEF to\nbriefly speak with #C236196003Kiara#CDEF.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 100,
      "msgctxt": "500012",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 100,
      "en": "I obtained the first #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nLet's briefly return to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and sort\nout the situation.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "msgctxt": "500132",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 9,
      "en": "First off, let's activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nThen we can explore without worry.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "msgctxt": "500228",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 100,
      "en": "What's wrong, Praetor?\nLet's #C000246204continue onward#CDEF!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "msgctxt": "500292",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 100,
      "en": "Don't worry. I'll protect you, Darling.\nSo, continue on #C000246204ahead#CDEF.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 104,
      "msgctxt": "500372",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 100,
      "en": "Surely you're not telling me that you're\nfrightened? Even you understand that stopping\nhere is impermissible, yes?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 105,
      "msgctxt": "500488",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 100,
      "en": "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. After you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nplease have yourself a rest in your\nprivate room.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 106,
      "msgctxt": "500616",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 100,
      "en": "Even in cyberspace, you need proper rest.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 107,
      "msgctxt": "500660",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 100,
      "en": "Once you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nuse it to get back here.\nI'll bet you're exhausted, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 108,
      "msgctxt": "500788",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 101,
      "en": "#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, return to base for now.\nLet's discuss our plan\nin the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 109,
      "msgctxt": "500916",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 100,
      "en": "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, please come back.\nYou've accumulated a lot of fatigue;\nany more will be dangerous!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 110,
      "msgctxt": "501024",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 100,
      "en": "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's worried state gets across to\nme even over the transmission.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 111,
      "msgctxt": "501112",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 100,
      "en": "She's right, it would be best if\nwe returned to the #C000246204Old School Building#CDEF.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 112,
      "msgctxt": "501204",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 9,
      "en": "We obtained the #C000246204SG#CDEF. Let's return to the\n#C000246204old school#CDEF for the time being. We can come\nagain after we recover.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 113,
      "msgctxt": "501344",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 100,
      "en": "We got the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nMission complete.\nLet's head home and get some rest.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 114,
      "msgctxt": "501428",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 100,
      "en": "Where are you going? We secured the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nThere's nothing urgent to tend to.\nBack to #C000246204My Room#CDEF, now.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 115,
      "msgctxt": "501560",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 100,
      "en": "Hrrrm? Where are you going, #C236196003#FAMILY\n#GIVEN#CDEF? Where are you going,\nleaving me behind?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 116,
      "msgctxt": "501660",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 100,
      "en": "For a second there, I was thinking about\nleaving #C236196003Gatou#CDEF and heading back,\nbut it probably won't rest easy on my conscience,\nso let's turn back.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 117,
      "msgctxt": "501820",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 100,
      "en": "Wait, Praetor. If we're going to head back,\nit'll behoove us for the future to have\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF activated.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 118,
      "msgctxt": "501948",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 100,
      "en": "Master, let's look for the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nIt should be around here somewhere…",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 119,
      "msgctxt": "502040",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 100,
      "en": "We don't need to walk all the way back.\nWe can use the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF to reach the\nold school in a flash. Very nifty.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 120,
      "msgctxt": "502172",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 100,
      "en": "M-my stomach is at its limit…\nI want to hurry back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and get some rest…",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 121,
      "msgctxt": "502272",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 9,
      "en": "The next floor is up ahead.\n#C000246204We have to press on#CDEF so that his wishes\ndon't end up for naught.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 122,
      "msgctxt": "502380",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 100,
      "en": "Huh? You're still in the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF?\nCome on, there's nothing to do there.\nGet your butt back here!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 123,
      "msgctxt": "502504",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 100,
      "en": "We'll talk about what comes next tomorrow,\nso #C000246204come back and get some rest#CDEF.\nAfter, drop by the Student Council Room.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 124,
      "msgctxt": "502636",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 100,
      "en": "We're in a race against time.\nWe need to hurry to the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF――!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 125,
      "msgctxt": "502728",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 103,
      "en": "Praetor, I've grown tired. Let us return\nto My Room and have ourselves a bath.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 126,
      "msgctxt": "502808",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 103,
      "en": "I know how you feel, but knowing\nwhen to rest is also part of the battle.\nLet's head back to My Room.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 127,
      "msgctxt": "502912",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 103,
      "en": "Darling, now is the time for rest.\nLet's return to our room and\nrecover our strength.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 128,
      "msgctxt": "503000",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 103,
      "en": "What an impatient #[man][woman]#. Laboring away\nis not all there is to life, you know?\nWhen it's time to rest, rest.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 129,
      "msgctxt": "503120",
      "tipo": "unk_op1650",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF.",
      "pt": "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
    },
    {
      "id": 130,
      "msgctxt": "503204",
      "tipo": "unk_op1650",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game.",
      "pt": "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."
    },
    {
      "id": 131,
      "msgctxt": "503284",
      "tipo": "unk_op1650",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving.",
      "pt": "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."
    },
    {
      "id": 132,
      "msgctxt": "503352",
      "tipo": "unk_op1653",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "Would you like to save your Clear Data?",
      "pt": "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"
    },
    {
      "id": 133,
      "msgctxt": "503392",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 2,
      "en": "I see… this is the mental wall that formed\nin the Labyrinth… Now that I actually see it,\nit is quite seductive.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 134,
      "msgctxt": "503508",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 2,
      "en": "Seductive?\nWhy not use words like \"ugly\" or \"beautiful\"?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 135,
      "msgctxt": "503568",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 2,
      "en": "Because. This figure is unable to visualize its\ntrue feelings, making it a prisoner to its own\nheart. Its #RUBS anguish#RUBEshadow#REND is proof that it exists.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 136,
      "msgctxt": "503732",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 2,
      "en": "Its strength. Its suffering…\nTogether, how else can one describe these\ntowering sensations, if not \"seductive\"?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 137,
      "msgctxt": "503848",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 2,
      "en": "So, let us end our chat here. Once you enter,\nmy voice will no longer reach you. You'll also\nbe unable to exit out of your own will.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 138,
      "msgctxt": "503984",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I nodded to #C236196003Kiara#CDEF to let her know I\nlistened to her warning.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 139,
      "msgctxt": "504064",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 2,
      "en": "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF, please begin with your support.\nRelax and do as I instructed you.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 140,
      "msgctxt": "504156",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 2,
      "en": "Yes, ma'am. I-I'll do my best! I'll use my\ncalculative capabilities to get us there with\na margin of error no greater than 0.0001!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 141,
      "msgctxt": "504288",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 2,
      "en": "From your Frame, we rip the concept of a soul.\nAfter its disassembly and conversion into pure\ndata, a Spiritron-Border will rig the model.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 142,
      "msgctxt": "504428",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 2,
      "en": "Assigning values to Master #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF. After\nreaching the deeper regions of her mental image\nspace, you'll reload in your new digital form.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 143,
      "msgctxt": "504588",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 2,
